  "chapter": {
    "bookTitle": "Psalms",
    "delineation": "Psalm",
    "number": 26,
    "summary": "David says that he has walked in integrity and obedience—He loves the Lord’s house.",
    "chapterAugmentations": [],
    "verses": [
      {
        "text": "Judge me, O Lord; for I have walked in mine integrity: I have trusted also in the Lord; therefore I shall not slide.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 62,
            "end": 69,
            "text": "TG Trust in God."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 88,
            "end": 97
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "Examine me, O Lord, and prove me; try my reins and my heart.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 24,
            "end": 29,
            "text": "TG Test."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "For thy lovingkindness is before mine eyes: and I have walked in thy truth.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 23,
            "end": 25
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "I have not sat with vain persons, neither will I go in with dissemblers.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 20,
            "end": 24,
            "text": "Ps. 1:1; Jer. 15:17; Rom. 12:9; D&C 38:42."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "I have hated the congregation of evil doers; and will not sit with the wicked.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 7,
            "end": 12,
            "text": "TG Hate."
          },
          {
            "start": 33,
            "end": 37,
            "text": "D&C 68:1."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "I will wash mine hands in innocency: so will I compass thine altar, O Lord:",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 7,
            "end": 11,
            "text": "TG Wash."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "That I may publish with the voice of thanksgiving, and tell of all thy wondrous works.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 71,
            "end": 79,
            "text": "1 Chr. 16:9; Ps. 9:1; D&C 76:114."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "Lord, I have loved the habitation of thy house, and the place where thine honour dwelleth.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 74,
            "end": 80,
            "text": "OR glory, presence."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "Gather not my soul with sinners, nor my life with bloody men:",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 50,
            "end": 56,
            "text": "IE bloodguilty."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "In whose hands is mischief, and their right hand is full of bribes.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 60,
            "end": 66,
            "text": "TG Bribe."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 15,
            "end": 17
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "But as for me, I will walk in mine integrity: redeem me, and be merciful unto me.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "My foot standeth in an even place: in the congregations will I bless the Lord.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 42,
            "end": 55,
            "text": "TG Assembly for Worship."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": []
      }
    ]
  },
